---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="[Free Event | Zoom + YouTube] My AI and Me ~ Entrepreneurship Journey Session 2 & 'When New Media Meets AI Agents' Fireside Chat" description="Following the first session of 'My AI and Me ~ Entrepreneurship Journey' and the 'New Media Meets AI Agents' series, we present an interactive fireside chat featuring practitioners in AI music, video creation, and AI agent workflows." path="/en/posts/2026-08-13-my-ai-and-me-entrepreneurship-second-fireside-chat/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to Home</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">
          <time datetime="2026-08-13">August 13, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">Event Notice</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          [Free & Public Event | Zoom + YouTube] My AI and Me ~ Entrepreneurship Journey Session 2 & "When New Media Meets AI Agents" Fireside Chat
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 flex items-center gap-x-2">
          <span>Organizers: ZJUAANC & NACUAA DC</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          Hello everyone!
        </p>
        <p>
          Following the first session of "My AI and Me ~ Entrepreneurship Journey" and the "New Media Meets AI Agents" series of lectures, we are hosting an open, highly interactive fireside chat.
        </p>
        <p>
          This session bridges entrepreneurship with AI agents empowering new media, bringing together guests with hands-on experience in AI music, video creation, and agent applications to discuss:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-blue-300 font-medium">
          <li>When New Media Meets AI Agents,</li>
          <li>When Engineers Meet Content Creators,</li>
          <li>When Developers Become Product Managers——</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-semibold text-white text-lg">
          New horizons of music and video creation in the era of AI Agents.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">📅 Date & Time</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Pacific Time (PDT)</strong>: Saturday, Aug 15, 5:30 PM – 7:00 PM</li>
          <li><strong>Eastern Time (EDT)</strong>: Saturday, Aug 15, 8:30 PM – 10:00 PM</li>
          <li><strong>Beijing Time (CST)</strong>: Sunday, Aug 16, 8:30 AM – 10:00 AM</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🎥 Format & How to Join</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Zoom Online Meeting + YouTube Live Stream</strong> (Recording available after the event).<br />
          A relaxed 90-minute fireside chat with guest presentations, live demonstrations, and interactive Q&A.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🎯 Key Topics & Highlights</h3>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Real-world tools and workflows for AI music & video creation in 2026</strong></li>
          <li><strong>How creators produce original songs, MVs, and virtual singer tracks with AI</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Publishing and distributing AI music works to Spotify, YouTube, etc.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Advantages, limitations, and practical agent combinations in content creation</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Real entrepreneurial insights and pitfall avoidance on the journey</strong></li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🎤 Guest Speakers</h3>

        <!-- Speaker Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
          <!-- Peter Wu -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center hover:border-blue-500/40 transition-colors">
            <a href="/images/speaker_peter.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
              <img src="/images/speaker_peter.jpg" alt="Peter Wu" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-blue-500 mx-auto mb-4 shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
            </a>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Peter Wu</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              40-year tech veteran, AI agent entrepreneur, CEO of creator company, speaker of Session 1
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Sueana -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center hover:border-pink-500/40 transition-colors">
            <a href="/images/speaker_xuan.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
              <img src="/images/speaker_xuan.jpg" alt="Sueana" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover object-top rounded-full border-4 border-pink-500 mx-auto mb-4 shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
            </a>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Sueana</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Independent musician, photographer, and AI video creator. Pioneer of "Voice-to-Score" creation, released 5 original music albums.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Kaibo Huang -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-colors">
            <a href="/images/speaker_kaibo.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
              <img src="/images/speaker_kaibo.jpg" alt="Kaibo Huang" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-emerald-500 mx-auto mb-4 shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
            </a>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Kaibo Huang</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Former Senior Web Development Engineer at Kaiser, AI programming coach, AI music composer. Multi-startup founder
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 刘斌 (Bin Liu) -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-colors">
            <a href="/images/speaker_michael.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
              <img src="/images/speaker_michael.jpg" alt="刘斌 (Bin Liu)" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-purple-500 mx-auto mb-4 shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
            </a>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">刘斌 (Bin Liu)</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Former ZJU faculty member, 28-year tech veteran, physical AI agents & system architectures; Vice President of ZJUAANC, Chair of NACUAA AI Venture Club
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
          <strong>Co-Hosts</strong>: 刘斌 (Bin Liu) & Kaibo Huang
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🏛️ Organizers & Partners</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Host Organizations</strong>: ZJUAANC, NACUAA DC</li>
          <li><strong>Co-Organizers</strong>: AI Agent Alliance, ZJU AI Agent, VIAI Foundation, VIAI Charity Foundation</li>
          <li><strong>Assisting Organizations</strong>: ZJU Alumni Associations of TN, PA, RI, FL; NACUAA NC, SC, Washington DC Chapters; NACUAA AI Venture Club</li>
          <li><strong>Media Partner</strong>: North Alpha Post (北美发布)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">📱 WeChat Community & QR Codes</h3>
        <p>
          All alumni and friends interested in AI music, short videos, content creation, and AI agent entrepreneurship are welcome to attend. Free event with limited spots!
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8">
          <div class="text-center space-y-2">
            <a href="/images/my_ai_and_me_2_qr_1.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block group">
              <img src="/images/my_ai_and_me_2_qr_1.jpg" alt="WeChat Group QR Code 1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-xl object-contain group-hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors" />
            </a>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">WeChat Community Group QR Code 1 (Click for fullsize / Scan for Zoom Link)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center space-y-2">
            <a href="/images/my_ai_and_me_2_qr_2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block group">
              <img src="/images/my_ai_and_me_2_qr_2.jpg" alt="WeChat Group QR Code 2" class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-xl object-contain group-hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors" />
            </a>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">WeChat Community Group QR Code 2 (Click for fullsize / Scan for Zoom Link)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
